/-! # The Tenth source tensor at field width `64`

The compact source tensor of goctad (`tenthSrcXL w = twWidenT 4 w srcTenthCXLit`) costs about 19 s
    of
kernel time per evaluation (the widening); every tensor plan of the Tenth identifications starts
from it.  `t10X64` is the widened tensor as a literal (one kernel check, `t10X64_eq`). -/

@[expose] public noncomputable section
